          "name": "Remediation vulnerability counts by tag",
          "request": {
            "name": "Remediation vulnerability counts by tag",
            "description": {
              "content": "Returns before/after vulnerability counts per image tag for remediation workflows (deduplicated per vulnerability).\nBefore = fixed + patch_available + creating_a_patch + researching; after = researching + creating_a_patch + patch_available only.\nOS vs app layer follows the same rules as list/summary (non–app ecosystems vs app ecosystems). Request order preserved; duplicate IDs may repeat; missing tags are zeros.\nPOST body fits long rrt_ids lists; levels includes os, app, or both (both → top-level + app_level).",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
